WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.335 --> 00:00:03.239
It's hard being a reporter.

00:00:03.951 --> 00:00:06.351
But if it were easy, everyone
would want to do it, right?

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.360
Right.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.800
♪♪

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.230
-Afternoon, comrades.
-Who are you guys?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.712
-The vigilantes for truth?
-We're very entrepreneurial.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.600
GIRL: I'm in high school now,
okay? Things are gonna be
different.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.240
I don't want them
to be different.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.892
You have to start doing
some normal kid stuff.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.480
Oh, my God.
Are those dead?

00:00:30.087 --> 00:00:33.353
GIRL: I thought I'd already
written the most important
story of my life,

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:34.760
but this was bigger.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.760
This town, there are all sorts
of rules you gotta play by.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.720
GIRL: I think something in the
harbor is making people sick.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.040
And they'd been covering
this up for years.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.551
♪ Messages keep getting clearer ♪

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:50.680
Oh, my God.

00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:52.897
♪ And I ain't got nothing to say ♪

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.480
GIRL: If we don't figure out
what they're covering up,

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.440
everyone in this town
could be in danger.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:00:59.960
We're not gonna let that happen.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:04.131
Seriously, you're like some
old person inside my house.

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:06.907
♪ There's something happening somewhere ♪

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.640
GIRL: This could be
how we find Richie.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.520
He saw something,
and that's why he got taken.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:12.240
♪♪ (continues)

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.569
WOMAN: Criminal trespassing--

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.969
-(dogs barking)
-...on a school night.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.120
But in a purposeful way...
for a good cause?

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.040
♪ You can't start a fire ♪

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:24.200
You need to get control
of your daughter.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.640
♪ Can't start a fire without... ♪

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:27.400
Is that supposed to be
some kind of a threat?

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.600
♪ This gun's for hire ♪

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.040
You have no idea what
these people are capable of.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.495
The hardest stories
to cover are the ones
you care most about.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.040
♪♪

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:40.780
We're young,
but we are not stupid!

00:01:40.973 --> 00:01:42.465
I'm not afraid of you!

00:01:43.944 --> 00:01:46.798
They cannot stop her
from speaking the truth!

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.560
♪ Just dancing in the dark ♪

